<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Strand posts yr shr loss after excepts.</title>
<headline>Strand posts yr shr loss after excepts.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended August 31 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, post-excepts (cts)     16.6 loss   vs  10.3</p>
<p>    Div (cts)			   -	   vs   -</p>
<p>    Attrib income		   1.66  loss  vs  0.31</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			   7.33  loss  vs  1.39</p>
<p>    Turnover			 12.06	  vs 19.43</p>
<p>    Exceptional item		4.79	  vs   -</p>
<p>Full name: Strand Group Holdings Ltd (industrial-holding)</p>
<p>NOTE - The group anticipated to return to profitability in 1997 but said meaningful growth in earnings would only occur in subsequent years.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
